; A weir-type flow divider splitting to a diverted link.
[OPTIONS]
FLOW_UNITS   CFS
FLOW_ROUTING KINWAVE

[JUNCTIONS]
J1  100  4

[DIVIDERS]
D1  98  C2  WEIR  2  1.5  3.3  4

[OUTFALLS]
O1  95  FREE
O2  94  FREE

[CONDUITS]
C1  J1  D1  300  0.013  0  0
C2  D1  O1  300  0.013  0  0
C3  D1  O2  300  0.013  0  0

[XSECTIONS]
C1  CIRCULAR  1.5  0  0  0
C2  CIRCULAR  1    0  0  0
C3  CIRCULAR  1.5  0  0  0
